From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Yicong Yang <yangyicong@hisilicon.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Jan 2026 10:29:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] KVM: arm64: Enable FEAT_{LS64, LS64_V} in the supported guest

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2139248

Using FEAT_{LS64, LS64_V} instructions in a guest is also controlled
by HCRX_EL2.{EnALS, EnASR}. Enable it if guest has related feature.

Acked-by: Arnd Bergmann <arnd@arndb.de>
Acked-by: Oliver Upton <oupton@kernel.org>
Signed-off-by: Yicong Yang <yangyicong@hisilicon.com>
Signed-off-by: Zhou Wang <wangzhou1@hisilicon.com>
Signed-off-by: Will Deacon <will@kernel.org>
(cherry picked from commit 151b92c92a45704216c37d6238efbffd84aac538 linux-next)
Signed-off-by: Matthew R. Ochs <mochs@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Jamie Nguyen <jamien@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Carol L Soto <csoto@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Nirmoy Das <nirmoyd@nvidia.com>
Acked-by: Abdur Rahman <abdur.rahman@canonical.com>
Acked-by: Noah Wager <noah.wager@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Brad Figg <bfigg@nvidia.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00392
Ledger-Origin: nvidia-6.17@c1bbd7eda55de380ed6f4b8aa5a98085a51a5aa3
---
 arch/arm64/include/asm/kvm_emulate.h | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 6 insertions(+)

diff --git a/arch/arm64/include/asm/kvm_emulate.h b/arch/arm64/include/asm/kvm_emulate.h
index 6cd7325a05d7..3f59b2b7c18c 100644
--- a/arch/arm64/include/asm/kvm_emulate.h
+++ b/arch/arm64/include/asm/kvm_emulate.h
@@ -673,6 +673,12 @@ static inline void vcpu_set_hcrx(struct kvm_vcpu *vcpu)
 
 		if (kvm_has_sctlr2(kvm))
 			vcpu->arch.hcrx_el2 |= HCRX_EL2_SCTLR2En;
+
+		if (kvm_has_feat(kvm, ID_AA64ISAR1_EL1, LS64, LS64))
+			vcpu->arch.hcrx_el2 |= HCRX_EL2_EnALS;
+
+		if (kvm_has_feat(kvm, ID_AA64ISAR1_EL1, LS64, LS64_V))
+			vcpu->arch.hcrx_el2 |= HCRX_EL2_EnASR;
 	}
 }
 #endif /* __ARM64_KVM_EMULATE_H__ */
